  [Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; L