  emf (G5 q) (C4 q) = Some (T0, C4 q).
Proof.
  induction q as [|q IH].
  - repeat split; vm_compute; reflexivity.
  - destruct IH as (H1 & H2 & H3 & H4 & H5).
    repeat split.
    + cbn [C0 C1 G1]. phase.
    + cbn [C1 C2 G2]. phase.
    + cbn [C2 C3 G3]. phase.
    + cbn [C3 C4 G4]. phase.
    + cbn [C4 G5]. phase.
