    Level 1 starts at step 589,507 with zone B and tail b^518 (q = 43, r = 2).  Its
    reduced instance (tail b^2) ends in its 5th sweep, so the level ends after
    K2 + 1 sweeps with 3 K2 + 2 = 14 * 4^43, and K2 is the tail length of level 2.

    Generated file; every literal fact is re-checked by computation.

    AI assistance: this proof, the scripts and the checks were produced with the help of Claude (Anthropic). *)

Import Sim356 Blocks356 Ovf356 Tail356 Level356 Test356.
