Import Coq.Lists.List.
Import ListNotations.
Open Scope list_scope.
Open Scope nat_scope.

Definition Z0_1 : list L2 :=
  [Lb; Lb; La; Lb; Lb; Lb; La; Lb; Lb; Lb; La; Lb; Lb; La; Lb; Lb; Lb; La; Lb; Lb; Lb; La; Lb; Lb; La; Lb; Lb; Lb; La; Lb; Lb; Lb; Lb; La; Lb; Lb; Lb; La; Lb; Lb; Lb; La; Lb; Lb; Lb; La; Lb; Lb; Lb; La; Lb; Lb; Lb; La; La].

