(** * 1RB0RB_0LC1RA_1RD1LC_1LA1LE_1LF0LD_---0LA: the reduced instance of level 13 (layer 2b)

    Generated file.  The zone of the level, with its long runs written with symbolic
    counts, is swept until the level ends.  Literal stretches are computed by the
    evaluator of the symbolic words; each run with a symbolic count is crossed by a front.

    AI assistance: this proof, the scripts and the checks were produced with the help of Claude (Anthropic). *)

